SQL> @user_grant_copy.sql ADMIN_USER NEW_USER
--- SYSTEM PRIVILEGES ---
GRANT CREATE SESSION TO NEW_USER
GRANT CREATE TABLE TO NEW_USER
--- OBJECT PRIVILEGES ---
GRANT SELECT ON HR.EMPLOYEES TO NEW_USER
GRANT SELECT ON HR.DEPARTMENTS TO NEW_USER
--- ROLE GRANTS ---
GRANT CONNECT TO NEW_USER
GRANT RESOURCE TO NEW_USER
--- COPY COMPLETE ---

PL/SQL procedure successfully completed.
